! Lens module (MOD): CODE V "eikonal-based lens", object at infinity
LEN NEW
INS S2
EPD 20
YAN 0 7 10
PIM
MOD S1
MFL S1 50
MFD S1 10
MED S1 20
! perfect module: EFL/BFL 50, every ray of a field lands on f*tan(theta)
MOD
FIR
FOB 1
RAY 1 0
PRXYZ ALL
RAY -1 0
PRXYZ ALL
! spherical only (C11 = 1 wave): RMS OPD ~0.30 wave on axis
MCO S1 C11 1
FOB 0
CAPFN, 64
SHO RMSOPD
MCO S1 C11 0
! coma (Designing Optics Using CODE V, Commands 7.1)
MCO S1 C12 -200
FOB 1
RAY 1 0
PRXYZ ALL
RAY -1 0
PRXYZ ALL
! the legacy tracer bends the rays the same way
RAYENGINE OFF
FOB 1
RAY 1 0
PRXYZ ALL
RAYENGINE ON
! axial colour, principal planes moved: BFL 45, exit pupil 25 at -17.5
MCO S1 C12 0
MCO S1 C1 2
MCO S1 C3 -2
MFF S1 -40
MBF S1 45
MOD
FIR
PXTY ALL
! save and restore
MCO S1 C11 2.5
SAV lensmod
LEN NEW
RES lensmod
MOD
FIR
! the module follows a surface inserted in front of it
INS S1
MOD
DEL S1
MOD
! bad input
MOD S0
MOD S2
MFL S3 10
MFL S1 0
MED S1 -5
MRD S1 0.5
MFD S1 OBJ 5
MCO S1 C27 1
MCO S1 C4 1
MCO S1 C11 x
MOD S1 CHR
! SPH removes the module
SPH S1
MOD
